d it work to queue a resort, and add a queue_redraw inside update_draggers?\r\n\r\n`Container::_notification` already has `queue_sort` on `NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED`, so that wouldn't do anything.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3648526214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3648573142","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113948#issuecomment-3648573142","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113948","id":3648573142,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ZeM7W","user":{"login":"Koyper","id":33969780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTY5Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33969780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper","html_url":"https://github.com/Koyper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-13T00:13:54Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T00:13:54Z","body":"> I'm not sure what code you are talking about\r\n\r\nThanks for comments. I'm just referring to the new line of code in this PR. So prior to #90411 (which is fantastic, by-the-way!), that line also causes the theme overrides to update in the editor immediately.\r\n\r\n> We could move it back to SplitContainer's notification and update all draggers from there.\r\n\r\nYes I think so and call `update_touch_dragger` on all the `dragging_area_controls`, or would you call `_update_draggers` and add the touch dragger theme check there?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3648573142/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3648588454","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113948#issuecomment-3648588454","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113948","id":3648588454,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ZeQqm","user":{"login":"Koyper","id":33969780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTY5Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33969780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper","html_url":"https://github.com/Koyper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-13T00:23:26Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T00:23:26Z","body":"@kitbdev  I'm not sure what the protocol is for this, but since this is touching on your recent big commit, you are 