em. It's also not that urgent to fix that I would need to take it over IMO. The more people who work on SplitContainer and understand it the better it will be.\r\n\r\n> Yes I think so and call update_touch_dragger on all the dragging_area_controls, or would you call _update_draggers and add the touch dragger theme check there?\r\n\r\n`_update_draggers` is only called to add/remove the draggers themselves, so I wouldn't add logic there for the touch draggers theme. \r\n\r\nCalling `update_touch_dragger` on each dragging_area_control would work (the modulate would need to be added to it).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3648609403/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]